	"data": "The Harness Is the Debt\n\nOr: Why autonomous coding agents won't save you from architecture, and the evidence is already here.\n\nThe discourse around AI coding agents has a tell. On one side: breathless projections about autonomous software development, multi-day agent runs, entire games built without human intervention. On the other: cautious notes about \"keeping humans in the loop\" and \"augmentation not replacement.\" Both sides are arguing about the model — whether GPT-5.5 or Claude or the next…",
